1 NAME Elling Valle /Christophersen/
2 GIVN Elling Valle
2 _MARNM Christophersen
1 NAME Elling /Christophersen/
2 GIVN Elling
2 SURN Christophersen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1676
2 PLAC Nedre Valla
2 ADDR
3 STAE Nordland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 10 JUN 1730
2 PLAC Folda
2 ADDR
