1 NAME Job Dischington Nilsen /Busch/
2 GIVN Job Dischington Nilsen
2 _MARNM Busch
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1691
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bergen
3 STAE Hordaland
