1 NAME Søren Hagerup /Holck/
2 GIVN Søren Hagerup
2 SURN Holck
2 _MARNM Holck
2 NICK Søren Hagerup Holch
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 NOV 1744
2 PLAC Christiansund
